  "goodToKnow": "Die Bebauung is development, the buildings on a piece of land or the act of building on it: dichte Bebauung, die Bebauung eines Grundstücks. In Germany, der Bebauungsplan (B-Plan), set by the municipality, decides what can be built where, including height and use, so you can't simply build on your land. Bebauen means to build on, and bebaubar means buildable. Plural: die Bebauungen."
